WEBVTT

01:39.349 --> 01:40.934
You're Mr. Ha, aren't you?

01:43.103 --> 01:44.270
It's been a while.

01:45.605 --> 01:48.024
Yeon-jin doesn't have
a fitting scheduled for today.

01:48.858 --> 01:49.692
I know.

01:50.819 --> 01:52.487
Can I try this on?

01:53.822 --> 01:55.156
Where's your fitting room?

02:29.065 --> 02:30.316
It's a tight space,

02:31.151 --> 02:32.986
and there are people outside.

02:33.069 --> 02:34.821
But you and I feel so hot.

02:50.336 --> 02:51.171
I see…

02:53.923 --> 02:55.675
You always mean what you say, Yeon-jin.

03:05.185 --> 03:07.353
Your neighbors say
you get beaten up all the time.

03:08.271 --> 03:09.981
I was expecting much worse.

03:11.983 --> 03:15.069
I saw all sorts of pictures
in Moon Dong-eun's apartment.

03:16.279 --> 03:18.781
I recognized all of the faces…

03:23.077 --> 03:24.829
except this one.

03:26.789 --> 03:28.041
Anything you want to say?

03:29.542 --> 03:30.460
How…

03:31.502 --> 03:32.837
How did you even find me?

03:33.713 --> 03:34.547
It wasn't hard.

03:35.048 --> 03:38.843
EDEN APARTMENTS

03:48.394 --> 03:50.980
NEW MESSAGE: SHIN YEONG-JUN
VEHICLE REGISTRATION

03:51.064 --> 03:53.816
I didn't think about this before,
so I just looked into it.

03:53.900 --> 03:55.735
Moon Dong-eun owns two vehicles.

03:55.818 --> 03:58.154
I confirmed that the car
she is driving is 4225.

03:58.238 --> 04:00.365
I'll let you know
when I find out about 7943.

04:07.997 --> 04:09.916
No wonder there were so many photos.

04:18.800 --> 04:19.968
Hey, it's me.

04:20.677 --> 04:22.720
The bitch has somebody helping her.

04:23.554 --> 04:26.307
I know how to find out
who is using the 7943 car.

04:26.391 --> 04:28.768
Have someone follow me, starting tomorrow.

04:29.894 --> 04:34.232
I guess I got caught
because I was working too hard.

04:35.441 --> 04:37.068
You've lost your damn mind.

04:38.736 --> 04:41.239
You have no idea how much I know,
but you still test me?

04:45.868 --> 04:48.454
Just say it already.
Tell me what you want.

04:49.622 --> 04:50.873
But if you happen to

04:51.708 --> 04:53.960
breathe a single word
of this to my husband,

04:54.752 --> 04:55.753
I'll make you regret it.

04:57.255 --> 04:58.256
How would you do that?

04:58.339 --> 05:01.342
Now that it's come to this,
it's all or nothing.

05:02.552 --> 05:05.388
I'm more than happy to talk
to your husband too.

05:08.474 --> 05:10.310
Damn it, you're killing me.

05:11.686 --> 05:12.520
Listen closely.

05:14.647 --> 05:17.066
'Cause I'm about to say
something really classy.

05:19.027 --> 05:20.153
Lee Sun-a.

05:21.654 --> 05:24.907
Semyeong Middle School.
First year, Class Three.

05:28.911 --> 05:29.746
What?

05:30.830 --> 05:32.874
You're allowed to take
pictures of my daughter,

05:32.957 --> 05:34.792
but I can't do any research on yours?

05:37.211 --> 05:40.965
You go to my daughter's school,
but I can't even say your kid's name?

05:41.841 --> 05:44.385
This talk would've ended sooner
if I'd dragged her here

05:44.469 --> 05:45.511
by her hair, right?

05:46.637 --> 05:48.890
I'm so sorry. I am so sorry, ma'am.

05:49.390 --> 05:51.476
Please. Not my daughter, ma'am.

05:52.101 --> 05:53.186
Please!

05:53.269 --> 05:54.771
Do you understand now?

05:55.813 --> 05:57.940
You picked the wrong approach with me.

05:58.858 --> 06:00.360
I'm much more shameless than you.

06:10.745 --> 06:13.081
I'm calling you,
so make sure to save my number.

06:27.845 --> 06:30.515
Look at that… you have it already.

06:30.598 --> 06:32.266
BITCH WHO'LL END UP IN A DITCH

06:37.230 --> 06:38.064
Get it.

06:48.241 --> 06:49.659
It's a bit weird, isn't it?

06:50.827 --> 06:54.163
An elementary school teacher
and an ex-maid.

06:55.415 --> 06:57.417
What on earth do they have in common?

07:01.003 --> 07:02.380
I get it now.

07:03.589 --> 07:06.509
There is someone you want to kill.
Your husband.

07:07.677 --> 07:10.596
And Dong-eun wants
to kill someone too. Me.

07:15.268 --> 07:17.812
You both have somebody
who you want to kill.

07:21.941 --> 07:24.193
Well, let me offer you the same deal.

07:25.027 --> 07:27.822
Help me… and I'll kill your husband.

07:29.157 --> 07:31.993
I can have him killed
faster than Dong-eun ever could.

07:32.076 --> 07:35.163
I'll kill him tomorrow
so you can hold his funeral the next day.

07:35.663 --> 07:37.373
I can pay you instead if you want.

07:38.875 --> 07:43.379
But you have to do
whatever I tell you to do from now on.

07:45.173 --> 07:46.007
What do you say?

08:25.588 --> 08:27.590
Mom, what is it? Where are we going?

08:27.673 --> 08:30.009
Hurry up. Your dad will be up soon.

08:30.676 --> 08:31.511
Come on, run!

08:36.057 --> 08:38.059
Get in. We don't have much time.

08:43.356 --> 08:45.024
-Whose car is this?
-Buckle up.

08:45.107 --> 08:47.276
Don't roll down your windows, understand?

08:47.360 --> 08:49.195
Wait, Mom, you can drive?

09:06.712 --> 09:07.964
Are you warm enough?

09:08.464 --> 09:10.800
Get some sleep. I'll wake you when I stop.

09:12.885 --> 09:14.136
Where are we going?

09:14.220 --> 09:15.471
I don't know yet.

09:16.055 --> 09:18.474
But we're going to keep driving for now.

09:19.141 --> 09:19.976
Why?

09:20.059 --> 09:23.646
Because they might be following us.

09:25.398 --> 09:28.651
We'll come back to Semyeong tomorrow
or the day after.

09:29.151 --> 09:29.986
Why?

09:30.069 --> 09:32.321
I should have lost them by then,

09:32.863 --> 09:34.699
and I know where it'll be safe to go.

09:34.782 --> 09:36.701
But for now, don't ask questions.

09:37.201 --> 09:39.787
Please, just do as I say, okay?

09:41.372 --> 09:44.625
Mom, you're so badass! Awesome!

09:44.709 --> 09:47.128
Let's listen to music.
I'm going to play oppa's song!

10:07.106 --> 10:11.944
This device is switched off.
Please leave a message after the beep.

10:12.028 --> 10:13.946
MS. KANG

10:15.698 --> 10:17.199
What are you doing after work?

10:18.409 --> 10:19.910
I'm meeting somebody.

10:21.704 --> 10:24.790
Really? But there's
a faculty meeting today.

10:24.874 --> 10:26.876
It's about the school field trip.

10:27.627 --> 10:28.628
That's today?

10:29.211 --> 10:30.796
No one told me anything about it.

10:30.880 --> 10:33.215
I know. It just got scheduled.

10:34.508 --> 10:35.926
The teachers' room at five!

10:40.973 --> 10:44.060
We'll have to put everything together
regarding the festivals

10:44.143 --> 10:46.562
that are taking place
over the next two months.

10:46.646 --> 10:50.399
And we also need to select
another bus company.

10:50.483 --> 10:52.151
We'll have to review
what we did last year,

10:52.234 --> 10:55.655
and print out the field trip records
from the other schools too.

10:55.738 --> 10:58.324
The records from last year
won't be enough.

10:58.866 --> 11:02.536
We'll need to look into
the past five years, at least.

11:02.620 --> 11:05.039
So we've decided on the framework.

11:06.749 --> 11:07.833
Ms. Moon,

11:08.542 --> 11:10.878
you can handle
all of that yourself, right?

11:12.463 --> 11:13.964
All of that by myself?

11:17.343 --> 11:18.886
That's what we all decided on.

11:18.969 --> 11:20.971
Let me know if you have any objections.

11:25.476 --> 11:28.062
I don't have any objections.

11:29.355 --> 11:30.189
I'll do it.

11:30.856 --> 11:32.024
I just said that.

11:32.692 --> 11:33.609
You'll do it.

11:34.235 --> 11:37.238
HA YE-SOL

11:37.321 --> 11:38.823
Should I set it down in here?

11:39.323 --> 11:41.617
Right there. Over to the left.

11:43.369 --> 11:45.621
This is their most expensive one,
isn't it?

11:45.705 --> 11:47.039
Of course.

11:47.123 --> 11:48.874
Imported straight from Italy!

11:48.958 --> 11:50.876
Probably costs as much as a used car.

11:51.627 --> 11:52.962
How old is your kid?

11:55.047 --> 11:56.882
-She's eight now.
-I bet she's very cute.

11:57.967 --> 12:00.720
Nowadays, people with kids
don't usually have dogs.

12:01.303 --> 12:02.138
Why?

12:02.221 --> 12:05.057
Well, don't people avoid
keeping furry animals

12:05.141 --> 12:08.644
because they say they're bad
for kids' breathing?

12:10.980 --> 12:12.815
I've got one more to bring in, sir.

12:20.781 --> 12:23.284
Can you please make this quick?

12:23.826 --> 12:25.995
I'm a little busy at the moment. Really.

12:26.579 --> 12:29.415
I'll send you an address.
Lure Yeon-jin there.

12:29.999 --> 12:31.000
That's your job.

12:31.667 --> 12:33.836
-I'm hanging up.
-Just… hold on a second.

12:34.462 --> 12:37.465
This is way too quick.
You have to at least tell me why.

12:37.965 --> 12:40.426
Exactly how am I supposed
to lure her there?

12:40.509 --> 12:42.720
We just had a fight.
I bet she won't answer my call.

12:43.637 --> 12:44.972
That's for you to figure out.

12:46.182 --> 12:49.685
Your dress looked pretty.
Your photo shoot is next week, right?

12:52.772 --> 12:55.608
Did my mother-in-law tell you about that?

12:56.192 --> 13:00.029
You'd better get busy before we start
discussing other things, Hye-jeong.

13:06.118 --> 13:07.578
CHOI HYE-JEONG

13:14.210 --> 13:17.296
You might want to go out
to the parking lot.

13:20.841 --> 13:22.843
Get your hands off me!

13:24.220 --> 13:25.221
Excuse me, ma'am.

13:26.222 --> 13:28.224
I asked you who you are.

13:29.433 --> 13:32.853
Hey! Just a moment!
I said I'm looking for somebody!

13:33.354 --> 13:34.188
Oh God.

13:34.271 --> 13:36.774
Gosh, that little…

13:38.609 --> 13:39.944
What's gotten into you?

13:41.070 --> 13:42.321
You can't do that.

13:42.404 --> 13:44.323
-Come on, you need to go.
-I swear this bitch…

13:44.406 --> 13:47.368
Hey, mister! Seriously! Come on!

13:47.451 --> 13:48.786
Where is she?

13:52.581 --> 13:55.000
There she is. My daughter!

13:57.002 --> 13:58.921
It's me! Mommy!

13:59.004 --> 14:01.006
How've you been?

14:06.929 --> 14:09.265
Hey. There's somebody here for you.

14:10.683 --> 14:12.184
It's nice to see you, ma'am.

14:12.685 --> 14:14.353
I'm a friend of Dong-eun's.

14:15.020 --> 14:16.730
Haven't you lost contact with her?

14:34.915 --> 14:36.667
So, you're saying

14:37.626 --> 14:39.753
Dong-eun is working at a school now?

14:40.379 --> 14:42.798
As what? A janitor?

14:45.676 --> 14:46.677
A lunch lady?

14:47.595 --> 14:49.430
So you have no idea.

14:49.513 --> 14:51.015
Dong-eun's a teacher now.

14:53.976 --> 14:55.477
A teacher?

14:57.229 --> 14:58.564
A public servant?

15:00.232 --> 15:01.984
Dong-eun's a public servant, now?

15:02.067 --> 15:04.528
Well, it's a private school, so not quite.

15:05.112 --> 15:06.572
Anyway, ma'am,

15:06.655 --> 15:10.326
could you please get Dong-eun
fired from her school for me?

15:14.914 --> 15:17.416
You're one crazy bitch, aren't you?

15:18.334 --> 15:19.585
Who the hell are you?

15:20.711 --> 15:23.464
Why would I get her fired
from a job that pays her so well?

15:23.547 --> 15:26.383
Well, it's not like
you'd ever get any of that money.

15:27.176 --> 15:29.720
You two haven't spoken in over a decade.

15:32.765 --> 15:35.935
I'll give you more money
than Dong-eun could earn in her life.

15:37.353 --> 15:38.395
Damn it.

15:38.479 --> 15:39.438
Hey.

15:41.023 --> 15:42.858
I said, who the hell are you?

15:42.942 --> 15:45.694
Oh, you've never met me before, have you?

15:45.778 --> 15:48.948
But you met my mom, right?
You know, Dong-eun's withdrawal form.

15:49.031 --> 15:51.241
You signed. Don't you remember?

15:53.577 --> 15:55.913
You received a check back then, right?

16:00.501 --> 16:04.129
You just need to get her kicked out.
It's pretty similar to last time.

16:06.882 --> 16:08.884
Take this for the taxi ride there.

16:09.468 --> 16:11.303
And this for the taxi ride back.

16:11.387 --> 16:13.597
Make sure she signs her resignation,

16:14.139 --> 16:16.642
and then you can come
get the rest of your money.

16:23.983 --> 16:25.484
Where does she teach, then?

16:27.236 --> 16:29.071
It can't be in Semyeong, can it?

16:31.073 --> 16:31.991
How'd you know?

16:33.409 --> 16:36.328
Open this door!

16:40.499 --> 16:42.167
You're in there, aren't you?

16:43.752 --> 16:46.839
It's you. I looked up
exactly where you live.

16:47.339 --> 16:49.091
I know you're there.

16:49.675 --> 16:52.177
Open this door, right now!

16:53.345 --> 16:55.806
Why are you vandalizing my building?!

17:00.686 --> 17:03.272
A woman lives here, right?

17:04.231 --> 17:05.315
Moon Dong-eun?

17:06.400 --> 17:07.860
She's my daughter.

17:07.943 --> 17:09.069
Nobody's living there.

17:10.612 --> 17:14.616
I went all the way to the county office,
and they said she lives here.

17:15.534 --> 17:17.953
So don't lie to me!

17:18.454 --> 17:21.707
I already know she lives here.

17:26.128 --> 17:28.297
You think you can hide?

17:28.380 --> 17:30.007
Open up!

17:30.090 --> 17:32.426
I don't care what you heard
at the county office!

17:32.509 --> 17:35.095
I said nobody's here!
Why are you wrecking my building?

17:35.179 --> 17:36.847
Why, huh? Why?

17:36.930 --> 17:40.142
Fucking hell! You old bitch,
are you out of your mind?

17:40.225 --> 17:41.894
You bet I've lost it.

17:41.977 --> 17:44.730
This is my building. Get out now!

18:13.050 --> 18:15.219
My goodness.

18:16.178 --> 18:19.431
Just look at this place.

18:22.518 --> 18:24.103
Is it monthly or long-term?

18:25.104 --> 18:26.605
You don't own it, do you?

18:28.649 --> 18:29.983
How'd you find me?

18:30.859 --> 18:34.530
Gosh, you don't even have
a bottle of water in here.

18:35.572 --> 18:37.908
I can put up some new wallpaper for you.

18:38.408 --> 18:40.410
I know a guy who runs a wallpaper shop--

18:40.494 --> 18:41.787
How did you find me?

18:41.870 --> 18:45.624
How can you teach those kids
when you treat your own mother like that?

18:46.875 --> 18:50.212
So… when did you move into this place?

18:52.422 --> 18:55.342
When I was here in the spring,
she said that no one lived in here.

18:55.425 --> 18:57.678
You came here? Last spring?

18:57.761 --> 18:58.679
Of course!

18:59.179 --> 19:02.266
I'm your mom, after all.

19:02.933 --> 19:06.019
Blood is thicker than water, you know.

19:08.313 --> 19:09.898
Go hide again, if you'd like.

19:10.482 --> 19:11.984
I'll just find you again.

19:16.155 --> 19:17.489
You did it, Yeon-jin.

19:20.242 --> 19:23.829
You've found two new curling irons
to use against me.

19:40.220 --> 19:43.473
She's my friend, Dr. Joo.
Is it okay if she stays?

19:44.516 --> 19:46.268
I can't turn away free advertising.

19:46.351 --> 19:49.438
We're doing a two-for-one promotion.
Let me know if you're interested.

19:50.856 --> 19:53.567
I believe everything's worth
the price you pay for it.

19:54.693 --> 19:57.029
-When do you finish?
-About ten to fifteen minutes--

19:57.112 --> 19:59.615
Why didn't you just call me
when you were done?

19:59.698 --> 20:02.159
Go ahead. What's this about Dong-eun?

20:03.035 --> 20:05.704
I just wanted to tell you right away.

20:06.413 --> 20:08.081
Don't freak out.

20:08.999 --> 20:09.833
I mean it.

20:11.168 --> 20:14.588
Dong-eun plays Go with your husband.

20:17.132 --> 20:18.133
Seriously?

20:20.552 --> 20:22.054
How could you possibly know that?

20:23.472 --> 20:26.308
What the hell? Do you know how much that…

20:27.017 --> 20:30.520
-What if you scratched it?
-Oh, I'm so sorry, ma'am.

20:30.604 --> 20:32.731
It's fine. You can get on with your work.

20:35.776 --> 20:38.195
Why did you buy a bag
that's so far out of your league?

20:38.278 --> 20:41.323
Just use an eco-bag.
Now finish what you were saying.

20:41.406 --> 20:44.409
Who are you to say it's fine?
That's my bag!

20:45.452 --> 20:48.789
What? You think I took this
from our dry cleaners too?

20:48.872 --> 20:50.249
Well, I didn't.

20:50.332 --> 20:52.834
A rich, married man
bought this as a present for me.

20:52.918 --> 20:56.380
Don't take it that way. I'm saying
we should think about the environment.

20:57.214 --> 20:59.591
There's still a bit left.
Would you like some privacy?

20:59.675 --> 21:02.678
It's fine. I'm about to leave.
She must be in a mood today.

21:04.471 --> 21:06.723
Yeah, you're right. Just got my period.

21:07.224 --> 21:10.143
That's why I didn't get to sleep
with your husband that day.

21:10.227 --> 21:12.145
I was so fucking disappointed.

21:14.022 --> 21:15.649
What are you talking about?

21:18.819 --> 21:22.072
The married man who bought this for me
was your husband.

21:22.155 --> 21:25.200
Your husband was the one who told me
he plays Go with Dong-eun.

21:25.284 --> 21:26.952
Small fucking world, right?

21:29.955 --> 21:32.207
Did you meet with Do-yeong? No, wait…

21:35.085 --> 21:36.670
Did Do-yeong go out to meet you?

21:36.753 --> 21:38.922
Yeah. And he brought this with him.

21:40.340 --> 21:42.259
I should have told him everything.

21:42.759 --> 21:44.594
But our friendship stopped me.

21:47.514 --> 21:50.434
Please reserve my free procedure, Dr. Joo.

21:50.517 --> 21:52.227
I'll come back for it next time.

21:58.608 --> 22:01.278
Maybe your husband reserved me
for later too.

22:01.987 --> 22:03.905
I guess I'll be his two-for-one.

22:15.167 --> 22:18.420
He has high standards, doesn't he?
He bought her a Hermès bag.

22:18.920 --> 22:20.130
Are you interested?

22:21.548 --> 22:24.468
People always come back
after seeing my work.

22:26.094 --> 22:28.263
You must get
a lot of housewives from Semyeong.

22:29.431 --> 22:31.516
I'll think about coming here
on a gloomy day.

22:32.309 --> 22:35.312
Come get some filler on a rainy day
if you don't have an umbrella.

22:37.022 --> 22:38.815
It won't rain for a while though.

22:39.858 --> 22:40.776
See you later.

22:52.871 --> 22:55.165
-Get inside quick.
-Hey, get in there now!

22:55.248 --> 22:56.083
Get in!

22:56.917 --> 22:58.043
Come on!

23:14.226 --> 23:15.310
Hey, Park.

23:15.811 --> 23:18.397
Your team raided
a gambling den today, right?

23:21.441 --> 23:23.693
I told you to never gamble again,
didn't I?

23:25.237 --> 23:26.405
You went to a gambling den?

23:27.447 --> 23:28.740
Where'd you get the money?

23:31.618 --> 23:34.204
If I have to ask him
and hear it in his broken Korean,

23:34.704 --> 23:36.331
I'm going to kill you.

23:44.381 --> 23:45.215
So, then,

23:45.799 --> 23:47.467
there was a car accident,

23:48.135 --> 23:49.553
and you took money from her?

23:49.636 --> 23:53.140
I mean, people normally do that in
any accident. I thought it'd be natural--

23:56.351 --> 23:59.604
They say if you hire smart people,
they'll certainly backstab you.

23:59.688 --> 24:02.274
And dumbasses like you
just screw things up!

24:02.983 --> 24:06.820
I gave you thugs jobs to live off of,
and this is how you repay me?

24:07.863 --> 24:10.031
This is why I can never leave the force.

24:10.115 --> 24:13.618
I can't when you morons are screwing up
my business! Fucking asshole!

24:13.702 --> 24:16.121
Oh, stop it now and go away!

24:16.204 --> 24:19.666
I can't give you any more.
You think I'm running a charity here?

24:20.167 --> 24:23.086
I've only been putting up with you
for this long because of your wife!

24:23.170 --> 24:24.838
-Get out!
-Damn it!

24:25.338 --> 24:28.258
I'll pay when that bitch comes back!
I told you!

24:28.341 --> 24:30.677
That's what you said yesterday too!

24:30.760 --> 24:33.054
Don't come back until she returns.

24:33.555 --> 24:35.807
I wouldn't come back either if I were her.

24:35.891 --> 24:36.975
Come on, stop that!

24:37.058 --> 24:39.060
You fucking bitch! I should just…

24:39.561 --> 24:42.314
-My goodness.
-I'll set this fucking store on fire!

24:42.397 --> 24:45.150
-Can you ring me up?
-What the hell, bitch!

24:45.650 --> 24:48.445
I'll dig your eyes out.
I was in the damn line first!

24:48.528 --> 24:50.947
Hey, stop messing with my customer!

24:51.031 --> 24:52.741
I'm sorry. That's 1,200 won.

24:52.824 --> 24:53.909
Hold on.

24:54.659 --> 24:56.828
-Stop that--
-Let go! Really, come on!

24:57.412 --> 24:58.663
Oh, no, wait…

25:00.749 --> 25:04.169
I'm sorry I didn't get to meet you, ma'am.
Please call me.

25:11.176 --> 25:12.761
You were exactly right, ma'am.

25:13.345 --> 25:15.013
Park Yeon-jin did find me.

25:19.100 --> 25:21.144
MS. MOON

25:21.228 --> 25:22.312
I made a mistake.

25:22.812 --> 25:25.690
One of the pictures is gone.
The picture of Lee Seok-jae.

25:26.983 --> 25:29.236
You mean my husband?

25:29.319 --> 25:30.403
Yes.

25:30.487 --> 25:33.740
Yeon-jin might have found out about you.

25:38.119 --> 25:41.039
Don't worry, ma'am.
I'll call you when I can.

25:41.122 --> 25:42.541
I'm parking my car now.

26:03.270 --> 26:05.689
So I just turned off my phone,

26:06.273 --> 26:08.275
put Sun-a in the car and took off.

26:09.359 --> 26:10.527
I don't

26:11.570 --> 26:14.739
want you to misunderstand
what I was doing.

26:16.157 --> 26:17.033
Misunderstand?

26:18.243 --> 26:20.412
You know,

26:21.288 --> 26:24.457
you might think I've gone over
to her side, just like that.

26:26.501 --> 26:28.420
I already misunderstood you once,
didn't I?

26:30.505 --> 26:32.007
Have you eaten?

26:34.593 --> 26:35.427
Yeah.

26:43.810 --> 26:46.563
Please take good care of my Sun-a.

26:47.564 --> 26:49.816
I need to turn my phone back on

26:50.442 --> 26:52.444
and get back on Yeon-jin's radar.

26:53.486 --> 26:56.489
Everything we've done will become useless
if she meets my husband.

27:00.076 --> 27:02.329
Thankfully, that hasn't happened yet.
I made sure.

27:06.625 --> 27:09.461
And you shouldn't worry about Sun-a.

27:10.211 --> 27:11.046
Okay.

27:12.547 --> 27:14.424
I'll try to buy us some time.

27:14.924 --> 27:16.968
I'll ask for money first.

27:20.472 --> 27:23.725
From now on, I work for Park Yeon-jin,

27:24.559 --> 27:25.644
Moon Dong-eun.

27:41.743 --> 27:43.620
You'll stay here for the time being.

27:44.120 --> 27:45.622
I'm going to need your phone.

27:46.122 --> 27:48.208
From now on, you can't contact anybody

27:48.291 --> 27:50.960
other than me
and this lady over here, okay?

27:52.629 --> 27:54.047
But what about school?

27:55.006 --> 27:57.884
Your mother will withdraw you
from school tomorrow.

27:58.385 --> 28:00.887
You can finish high school
in the United States.

28:00.970 --> 28:02.806
Watch some American TV
to help your English.

28:03.682 --> 28:06.726
If I disappear,
my dad is going to kill Mom.

28:07.852 --> 28:11.773
He even said he'd kill my grandma
and my aunt if we ran away.

28:11.856 --> 28:13.608
That will never happen.

28:13.692 --> 28:16.111
Just trust your mother and wait.

28:17.904 --> 28:19.155
One thing I know for sure

28:19.864 --> 28:23.201
is that your mother is doing
all she can to protect you.

28:24.411 --> 28:26.496
This world can be very cruel.

28:27.914 --> 28:30.750
That's why you need to study abroad.

28:31.543 --> 28:33.503
Go and study as hard as you can.

28:34.879 --> 28:37.799
The only brave thing you can do right now

28:38.967 --> 28:39.926
is to turn away.

28:41.219 --> 28:44.055
Go on a trip occasionally
while you're studying,

28:44.139 --> 28:45.640
visit art museums,

28:46.808 --> 28:48.393
and eat a nice, leisurely dinner.

28:50.061 --> 28:51.479
That's how you should live.

28:52.647 --> 28:53.815
That's all you need.

29:03.783 --> 29:05.785
Ma'am, please take good care of her.

29:06.453 --> 29:07.537
Don't worry.

29:08.413 --> 29:11.166
Oh, you're still so young, aren't you?

29:12.584 --> 29:14.002
I've heard a lot about you.

29:14.502 --> 29:17.839
I was Ms. Moon's teacher
when she was a student.

29:17.922 --> 29:20.258
I had to quit being a teacher
a long time ago though.

29:21.009 --> 29:23.720
But it looks like I have a student
to take care of now.

29:25.054 --> 29:25.972
Come on.

29:30.769 --> 29:33.688
Want me to make some janchi-guksu?
You like noodles?

29:56.961 --> 29:59.464
I texted you earlier saying
I'd be out around ten.

30:00.048 --> 30:00.882
Didn't you see it?

30:01.758 --> 30:03.092
You really wanna go that far?

30:04.219 --> 30:06.387
You're the one who took it that far first.

30:08.223 --> 30:10.558
You met with Hye-jeong, didn't you? Why?

30:12.602 --> 30:13.603
Why?

30:14.103 --> 30:16.105
You're starting to scare me.

30:16.981 --> 30:19.359
I'm just trying to have
a calm conversation with you.

30:20.068 --> 30:22.987
The past is in the past,
and the future is what's ahead.

30:24.280 --> 30:25.949
I don't have any other options.

30:26.032 --> 30:27.700
I was curious about that, too.

30:28.952 --> 30:30.703
Whether you had other options.

30:30.787 --> 30:32.664
Why did it have to be Hye-jeong?

30:35.416 --> 30:38.753
Well, what did she say?
Do I have other options, or not?

30:38.837 --> 30:39.921
Who else could I ask?

30:40.922 --> 30:44.092
Sa-ra's no help because she's busy
ruining her life with drugs.

30:45.593 --> 30:46.928
Jae-jun, that punk?

30:47.428 --> 30:48.680
Myeong-o, who's missing?

30:48.763 --> 30:51.307
Your mother, who spends
her fortune on some shaman?

30:53.935 --> 30:55.478
Do you really have to do this?

30:57.146 --> 30:58.940
You're going to take their side?

31:05.697 --> 31:08.366
If I were siding with anyone,
it would be Ye-sol.

31:10.451 --> 31:13.955
If you felt even the slightest bit
of guilt for me and Ye-sol,

31:15.874 --> 31:18.376
you should've kept
your mouth shut and waited.

31:22.797 --> 31:24.841
But you don't feel any guilt towards us.

31:26.634 --> 31:27.635
I know you don't.

31:42.817 --> 31:44.903
-Anything new?
-No.

31:44.986 --> 31:46.571
I just took Louis to the groomer.

31:47.071 --> 31:48.281
You busy this weekend?

31:48.865 --> 31:50.700
The store's busiest on the weekends.

31:51.367 --> 31:54.203
-Why?
-We'll close this weekend, then.

31:54.787 --> 31:57.624
I want to get a Christmas present
for a girl,

31:57.707 --> 31:59.208
but don't know what she likes.

32:00.001 --> 32:02.670
Will you go to the mall with me?
She's pretty young.

32:03.671 --> 32:05.423
Can't you pick something from here?

32:06.341 --> 32:09.052
Is it the redhead?
Or the car show model with an accent?

32:09.135 --> 32:10.595
Aren't you listening?

32:10.678 --> 32:13.097
I need you to tell me
if something's green or red.

32:13.181 --> 32:14.974
Fuck, it's Christmas, so everything's…

32:16.476 --> 32:17.894
Are you free or not?

32:20.271 --> 32:21.689
What exactly counts as "new?"

32:22.440 --> 32:23.274
What?

32:23.358 --> 32:25.276
You asked if there was anything new.

32:26.194 --> 32:28.613
Yeon-jin's husband was here. On his own.

32:29.113 --> 32:31.449
Does that count as "anything new"?

32:33.159 --> 32:35.328
When was this? Why?

32:35.411 --> 32:36.829
I have no idea.

32:38.206 --> 32:40.249
He tried on a piece of clothing,
then left.

32:45.088 --> 32:46.214
OCTOBER
NOVEMBER

32:47.465 --> 32:49.717
Was that the first time
or was he here before?

32:49.801 --> 32:51.886
That was the first time I saw him.

32:51.970 --> 32:54.430
He might have come
when a part-timer was working.

32:55.556 --> 32:58.434
How long do we keep these?
None were deleted, right?

32:59.477 --> 33:01.145
We keep them for 30 days.

33:01.229 --> 33:04.607
But we don't have anything on
or before October 19th. I formatted it.

33:05.608 --> 33:07.777
You formatted it? Why?

33:08.736 --> 33:10.238
Yeon-jin asked me to erase it.

33:13.116 --> 33:14.534
There's Ha Do-yeong. Look.

33:49.944 --> 33:51.279
Son Myeong-o?

33:52.280 --> 33:53.614
Dr. Joo asked about him.

33:54.449 --> 33:56.451
He showed me some security footage

33:56.534 --> 33:58.703
and asked me if the man was Son Myeong-o.

33:59.495 --> 34:00.413
When was that?

34:00.913 --> 34:04.250
I told him all I knew about Myeong-o,
but he didn't tell me about the video.

34:04.333 --> 34:06.169
It was a little less than a month ago.

34:06.669 --> 34:08.296
I forgot about it

34:08.379 --> 34:11.215
until the police came to ask him
about Son Myeong-o.

34:12.925 --> 34:15.762
The police came to see Yeo-jeong?

34:19.932 --> 34:23.936
Wow, Dong-eun.
You've become one interesting bitch.

34:47.794 --> 34:49.212
Dr. Joo Yeo-jeong?

34:49.712 --> 34:50.880
I thought it was you.

34:51.380 --> 34:53.591
I saw you walking by,
but I wasn't too sure.

34:54.092 --> 34:56.010
You asked me a while ago

34:56.511 --> 34:59.097
to let you know
if anybody came to the mortuary.

34:59.180 --> 35:00.807
Right. Was it a woman?

35:00.890 --> 35:02.558
No, it was a man.

35:02.642 --> 35:04.560
It was about two hours ago.

35:07.146 --> 35:08.147
Here's his number.

35:09.982 --> 35:10.817
SON MYEONG-O

35:10.900 --> 35:12.485
I never actually met him.

35:13.069 --> 35:15.154
I just had his number.

35:15.238 --> 35:17.406
Then I called him once after a long time.

35:18.407 --> 35:19.659
When was that?

35:20.409 --> 35:22.245
October 19th, 11:15 p.m.

35:24.539 --> 35:27.542
But he hung up as soon as he picked up.
He cursed at me too.

35:28.334 --> 35:30.086
Your memory seems to be very accurate.

35:31.212 --> 35:32.713
I have the records on my phone.

35:34.382 --> 35:35.216
That's fair.

35:36.425 --> 35:37.844
Why did you call him?

35:39.345 --> 35:41.597
I was working
at Seoul Joo General Hospital then.

35:41.681 --> 35:44.183
There's a body
they've been keeping for a while.

35:44.267 --> 35:46.727
It's from a suicide case
that was concluded in 2004.

35:47.854 --> 35:50.106
But the family did not agree
with the report,

35:50.189 --> 35:52.441
so they're still not taking the body.

35:53.025 --> 35:56.028
I heard there had been a visitor,
so I thought it was family.

35:56.612 --> 35:58.281
But it turned out to be Mr. Son.

35:58.364 --> 36:00.366
Were you the person in charge?

36:00.449 --> 36:01.450
No.

36:03.870 --> 36:05.454
I forgot to tell you.

36:05.538 --> 36:08.791
The previous and current directors
of Joo Hospital are my parents.

36:09.917 --> 36:11.002
Oh, I see.

36:13.921 --> 36:17.008
Is there something wrong
with me calling him though?

36:18.092 --> 36:19.260
Well, not really.

36:20.136 --> 36:23.556
But you're the last person
to talk with Mr. Son on the phone.

36:27.852 --> 36:31.022
If you put it like that,
I sound super suspicious.

36:32.398 --> 36:33.316
What?

36:34.692 --> 36:36.027
I was just kidding.

36:37.278 --> 36:38.487
It wasn't funny, was it?

36:39.322 --> 36:41.657
Could you text me
if you have any other questions?

36:41.741 --> 36:43.075
I have an appointment soon.

37:23.991 --> 37:28.412
SON MYEONG-O

37:35.002 --> 37:36.337
So you wanted me…

37:39.340 --> 37:40.841
to find Son Myeong-o.

38:09.120 --> 38:11.372
The weather is great,
but I was feeling gloomy.

38:12.039 --> 38:13.708
And I heard you work nights too.

38:14.709 --> 38:15.876
I'm glad you came.

38:16.377 --> 38:19.422
People come here on sunny days
when they don't have a parasol.

38:21.007 --> 38:22.591
You have a girlfriend, don't you?

38:22.675 --> 38:24.927
Oh, do you have a lot of them?

38:26.137 --> 38:27.847
There is a girl who is clever

38:28.347 --> 38:30.474
and very pretty but also very cold.

38:30.558 --> 38:32.393
So you're dating a mean girl.

38:35.229 --> 38:38.983
How much… do guys usually forgive, then?

38:40.026 --> 38:41.819
Assuming the girl messed up pretty bad.

38:42.820 --> 38:43.904
I'm not sure.

38:45.364 --> 38:49.076
Guys usually want their women
to be beautiful without surgery.

38:50.453 --> 38:53.122
But they don't care
as long as they don't know about it.

38:54.457 --> 38:55.791
What if he already knows?

38:56.709 --> 38:58.294
Then you should get some filler.

38:58.878 --> 39:02.340
Although filler will disappear over time,
your beauty will remain.

39:02.423 --> 39:05.593
So you can play dumb until he finds out.

39:09.180 --> 39:11.349
I didn't know fillers were so romantic.

39:12.641 --> 39:15.394
Let's see if you are right.
I'll do general anesthesia.

39:15.478 --> 39:17.146
I need to see how you react to--

39:17.229 --> 39:19.231
Well, you're a good doctor anyway.

39:19.857 --> 39:21.859
I don't like the feeling of it going in.

39:23.444 --> 39:24.695
Okay, then get some sleep.

40:00.481 --> 40:02.900
I assume this will be
a long, private conversation.

40:04.068 --> 40:05.903
So I picked Seoul instead of Semyeong.

40:07.988 --> 40:10.116
I haven't been to Seoul in a while.

40:10.616 --> 40:11.450
This is nice.

40:14.912 --> 40:16.831
I heard about you and Yeon-jin.

40:17.706 --> 40:20.543
I doubt it.
There's no way you heard all of it.

40:33.556 --> 40:36.934
Propofol is going in through the IV,
so you'll start feeling sleepy.

40:37.977 --> 40:39.979
Count backwards from ten.

40:41.605 --> 40:42.440
Ten.

40:47.528 --> 40:49.363
Long time no see, Mr. Ha.

40:49.447 --> 40:50.281
Hello.

40:51.031 --> 40:52.366
Let me take your coat.

40:52.950 --> 40:53.951
Thank you.

40:55.911 --> 40:57.079
Nine.

41:15.514 --> 41:16.348
Eight.

41:20.478 --> 41:21.812
Oh, did you know?

41:23.731 --> 41:27.818
If I don't get all of the air out
before injecting a shot, you could die.

41:28.402 --> 41:29.236
Seven…

41:30.654 --> 41:31.489
What?

41:32.573 --> 41:33.741
What did you do

41:34.909 --> 41:36.076
to Son Myeong-o?

41:57.264 --> 41:58.098
Hey.

42:14.323 --> 42:16.575
-What are you looking at?
-One minute.

42:17.368 --> 42:18.369
My patience...

42:20.329 --> 42:21.747
What is it? Go ahead.

42:21.830 --> 42:23.999
Wow, you never change.

42:25.793 --> 42:27.294
Listen closely, Yeon-jin.

42:28.337 --> 42:30.172
You know that asshole, Jae-jun?

42:30.673 --> 42:33.759
I drive him around,
have conversations with him,

42:33.842 --> 42:35.928
drink with him, be a friend to him.

42:36.011 --> 42:39.431
I bet you know this too.
That I only graduated from high school,

42:39.515 --> 42:42.935
but I'm basically a college graduate
because I took classes for him.

42:44.144 --> 42:46.397
So it hurts my fucking pride

42:47.481 --> 42:48.566
to be called a driver.

42:48.649 --> 42:51.068
Get to the point. You're pissing me off.

42:52.903 --> 42:54.905
Yeah, that's exactly how I feel.

42:55.447 --> 42:57.366
If I were him, I would have spent

42:57.866 --> 43:00.869
my time better and become
a director at Jaepyeong Construction

43:01.870 --> 43:03.289
instead of fucking with you.

43:12.089 --> 43:13.340
Who the fuck…

43:14.258 --> 43:15.843
Hey, you fucking asshole.

43:16.677 --> 43:17.678
Don't call me.

43:22.308 --> 43:25.394
-I'm guessing you were recording this.
-What are you talking about?

43:26.186 --> 43:28.314
These damn druggies keep calling me.

43:30.524 --> 43:31.525
Hey, what the fuck…

43:33.485 --> 43:35.738
-Have you lost your damn mind?
-Myeong-o.

43:35.821 --> 43:38.032
Honestly, I was expecting a bit more.

43:38.532 --> 43:40.075
But my affair is all you have?

43:41.076 --> 43:43.203
If you want to threaten me, try harder.

43:44.413 --> 43:46.540
It's not that easy to make money,
you know.

43:48.208 --> 43:49.793
I'll get you a new phone.

43:58.802 --> 44:00.095
How about this one, then?

44:01.472 --> 44:02.389
Yoon So-hee.

44:08.145 --> 44:09.229
Yoon So-hee?

44:10.356 --> 44:11.190
Who's that?

44:11.273 --> 44:13.359
Wow, you fucking bitch!

44:15.402 --> 44:19.323
Her body is still at Joo General Hospital.
It's been there for over a decade.

44:20.824 --> 44:23.494
I know you were there
on the rooftop that day.

44:23.994 --> 44:25.913
What the hell are you talking about?

44:27.164 --> 44:30.250
-You're not making any sense.
-It should make sense though.

44:32.127 --> 44:34.630
The evidence to prove
that you were there that day…

44:38.092 --> 44:39.259
is right in here.

44:41.970 --> 44:45.557
That's right!
Now you're showing your true self!

44:48.852 --> 44:50.354
You can see it for yourself.

44:51.021 --> 44:54.692
I'm going to take this
to your broadcasting station tomorrow.

45:22.678 --> 45:24.096
Wow, fuck!

45:24.179 --> 45:26.348
This will make it way easier to bargain!

45:26.849 --> 45:28.684
So you were actually there!

45:31.311 --> 45:33.063
I don't want the director position.

45:33.731 --> 45:34.648
Just give me cash.

45:35.149 --> 45:37.401
Let's start with a billion won.

45:40.028 --> 45:41.029
You son of a bitch!

45:55.836 --> 45:57.838
This is precious stuff, Yeon-jin.

45:58.547 --> 46:00.048
It's strawberry-flavored.

46:02.176 --> 46:03.010
If you let me…

46:04.928 --> 46:07.222
use this on you,
I'll subtract ten million won.

46:08.015 --> 46:11.018
If you let me cum without using it,
I'll subtract ten million more.

46:11.101 --> 46:11.935
What do you say?

46:14.605 --> 46:17.357
Oh, right. I almost forgot.

46:18.192 --> 46:19.109
What should I do?

46:23.363 --> 46:24.948
Your one minute has passed!

47:05.155 --> 47:06.073
And then?

47:10.661 --> 47:12.329
What happened after that?

47:13.914 --> 47:15.332
What? Who is that?

47:17.125 --> 47:18.043
Whose voice is that?

47:26.468 --> 47:28.220
Are you awake, Ms. Park?

49:39.685 --> 49:44.690
Subtitle translation by: Daham Yoon
